OL,3,GNEWSAChamber asks about future of
OL,4,AGuernsey tax system
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Guernsey Chamber of Commerce has
OL,7,Fquestioned whether the island's tax
OL,8,Fsystem needs to be redesigned following
OL,9,Fthe publication of the scale of the
OL,10,FRevenue Service backlog.
OL,12,FA report published by the Revenue
OL,13,FService revealed there were 106,444
OL,14,Foutstanding pieces of work, including
OL,15,Ftax assessments, repayments and
OL,16,Fbereavement cases.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,442,440,260,160,0,100
