OL,3,GNEWSAChamber asks about future of
OL,4,AGuernsey tax system
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe chamber welcomed the States'
OL,7,Fdecision to publish what it described
OL,8,Fas a "full and honest account" of the
OL,9,Fproblem, but said businesses and
OL,10,Fislanders had been experiencing its
OL,11,Feffects for years.
OL,13,FThe organisation has now asked the
OL,14,FStates to set out its longer term
OL,15,Fdigital strategy for tax and whether
OL,16,Fmore fundamental changes to the system
OL,17,Fare being considered.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
